From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 01:38:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add independent Sunday/Wednesday fasting reminder scheduler

Opt-in fasting_reminder columns, profile GET/PATCH fields, and a
separate minute cron that DMs users only on Sun/Wed at their time
with rotating hadith and Monday/Thursday framing.
